<title>NORWAY: Norway's May foreign trade surplus NOK 8.25 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway's May foreign trade surplus NOK 8.25 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	 MAY 1997   APRIL 1997   MAY 1996</p>
<p> Imports			     18.62	 21.83	  17.69</p>
<p> Exports			     26.87	 29.07	  24.11</p>
<p> Balance				8.25	  7.23	   6.42</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		 -5.29	 -6.73	  -5.50</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
